--Description / thinking process:
-- 1) We already know the five closest stations to downtown NYC.
-- 2) The next logical step is to discover which of these stations actually
--    contains *valid* (qflag IS NULL) precipitation (PRCP) rows for 2016.
-- 3) Counting rows per station quickly tells us which candidate has usable data
--    before we start pulling daily values in detail.
-- 4) The query therefore filters on:
